"Whether to retrieve details about items when making listing on repositories"
msgstr "Treba li dohvatiti pojedinosti o stavkama prilikom izrade popisa na repozitorijima"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_details_on_remote_listing)
#: src/settings/subversion_settings.ui:61
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p align=\"left\">When checked, kdesvn fetches more detailed info about file "
"items when making a listing to remote repositories so that you may see "
"remote locks in overview.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"left\"><i>Be careful: This may let listings become REAL slow.</"
"i></p>"
msgstr "<p align=\"left\">Kada je označeno, kdesvn dohvaća detaljnije informacije o stavkama datoteke prilikom izrade popisa udaljenih repozitorija tako da možete vidjeti udaljena zaključavanja u pregledu. oglasi postaju STVARNO sporo.</i></p>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_details_on_remote_listing)
#: src/settings/subversion_settings.ui:64
#, kde-format
msgid "Get file details while remote listing"
msgstr "Dobijte pojedinosti o datoteci tijekom udaljenog popisa"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_info_recursive)
#: src/settings/subversion_settings.ui:74
#, kde-format
msgid "Get item info recursively"
msgstr "Rekurzivno dobivanje informacija o artiklu"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_properties_on_remote_items)
#: src/settings/subversion_settings.ui:84
#, kde-format
msgid "Should kdesvn retrieve properties on selected item in repositories"
msgstr "Treba li kdesvn dohvatiti svojstva odabrane stavke u spremištima"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_properties_on_remote_items)
#: src/settings/subversion_settings.ui:88
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"When browsing, kdesvn may try displaying properties below itemlist from a "
"selected item. \n"
"On networked repositories (e.g., not opened via file:// protocol) this may "
"get very slow. Thus, if you have slow network connections or when browsing "
"hangs often you should deactivate it."
msgstr "Prilikom pregledavanja, kdesvn može pokušati prikazati svojstva ispod popisa stavki iz odabrane stavke. \nU umreženim spremištima (npr. koja nisu otvorena preko file:// protokola) ovo može biti vrlo sporo. Stoga, ako imate spore mrežne veze ili ako pregledavanje često prestaje, trebali biste ga deaktivirati."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_properties_on_remote_items)
#: src/settings/subversion_settings.ui:91
#, kde-format
msgid "Always get properties on networked repositories"
msgstr "Uvijek dobivajte svojstva na umreženim spremištima"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_store_passwords)
#: src/settings/subversion_settings.ui:101
#, kde-format
msgid "Should Subversion store passwords by default"
msgstr "Treba li Subversion pohraniti lozinke prema zadanim postavkama"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_store_passwords)
#: src/settings/subversion_settings.ui:104
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Storing passwords is often a security problem. Kdesvn itself does not store "
"any passwords, but the Subversion itself inside the configuration area of "
"Subversion. If this area is readable from others you should not set it, but "
"you may select for single non critical accounts inside the authentication "
"dialog."
msgstr "Pohranjivanje lozinki često predstavlja sigurnosni problem. Sam Kdesvn ne pohranjuje nikakve lozinke, već sam Subversion unutar konfiguracijskog područja Subversion. Ako je ovo područje čitljivo od drugih, ne biste ga trebali postaviti, ali možete odabrati za pojedinačne nekritične račune unutar dijaloškog okvira za provjeru autentičnosti."

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_passwords_in_wallet)
#: src/settings/subversion_settings.ui:117
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"When saving passwords, do it into KDE Wallet instead of Subversions storage?"
msgstr "Kada spremate lozinke, učiniti to u KDE Wallet umjesto u Subverzionu pohranu?"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_passwords_in_wallet)
#: src/settings/subversion_settings.ui:122
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Tells if your passwords set in kdesvn should stored into KDE Wallet "
"instead of simple clear text storage of Subversion.</p>\n"
"<p>This would be a little bit more secure because KDE Wallet is (mostly) "
"encrypted with a password. On other hand you must re-enter your passwords "
"with other Subversion clients not accessing KDE wallet (e.g. svn command "
"line itself, rapidsvn and so on).</p>\n"
"<p>If you are HOME storage e.g. Subversion's config folder is on a network "
"drive you should hard think about not storing passwords in a plain text file "
"like Subversion does but put it into an encrypted storage like KDE Wallet or "
"do not save passwords.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Govori treba li vaše lozinke postavljene u kdesvn pohraniti u KDE novčanik umjesto jednostavnog pohranjivanja čistog teksta Subversion.</p>\n<p>To bi bilo malo sigurnije jer je KDE novčanik (uglavnom) šifriran lozinkom. S druge strane, morate ponovno unijeti svoje lozinke s drugim Subversion klijentima koji ne pristupaju KDE novčaniku (npr. sam svn naredbeni redak, rapidsvn i tako dalje).</p>\n<p>Ako ste KUĆNA pohrana, npr. Konfiguracijska mapa Subversion nalazi se na mrežnom pogonu, trebali biste razmisliti o tome da ne pohranjujete lozinke u običnu tekstualnu datoteku kao što to čini Subversion, nego da je stavite u šifriranu pohranu kao što je KDE novčanik ili ne spremate lozinke. </p>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_passwords_in_wallet)
#: src/settings/subversion_settings.ui:125
#, kde-format
msgid "Store passwords into KDE Wallet"
msgstr "Pohranite lozinke u KDE novčanik"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_use_password_cache)
#: src/settings/subversion_settings.ui:135
#, kde-format
msgid "Use an internal password cache"
msgstr "Koristite internu predmemoriju zaporke"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_log_always_list_changed_files)
#: src/settings/subversion_settings.ui:155
#, kde-format
msgid "Read detailed change lists"
msgstr "Pročitajte detaljne popise promjena"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_log_always_list_changed_files)
#: src/settings/subversion_settings.ui:158
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Reading lists of changed files may sometimes a little bit slow down things. "
"But if this feature is switched off, kdesvn may fail generating differences "
"between node changes from within the log viewer."
msgstr "Čitanje popisa promijenjenih datoteka ponekad može malo usporiti stvari. Ali ako je ova značajka isključena, kdesvn možda neće uspjeti generirati razlike između promjena čvorova unutar preglednika dnevnika."

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_review_commit)
#: src/settings/subversion_settings.ui:171
#, kde-format
msgid "List items next commit will send or not"
msgstr "Stavke popisa hoće li sljedeće uvrštavanje poslati ili ne"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_commit_hide_new)
#: src/settings/subversion_settings.ui:184
#, kde-format
msgid "Should unversioned items be displayed in commit dialog or not."
msgstr "Trebaju li neverzionirane stavke biti prikazane u dijalogu predaje ili ne."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_commit_hide_new)
#: src/settings/subversion_settings.ui:187
#, kde-format
msgid "Hide new items in commit box"
msgstr "Sakrij nove stavke u okviru za uvrštavanje"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_update_add_as_modification)
#: src/settings/subversion_settings.ui:197
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>If set, a local addition at the same path as an "
"incoming addition of the same node kind results in a normal node with a "
"possible local modification, instead of a tree conflict.</p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>Ako je postavljeno, lokalni dodatak na istoj stazi kao i dolazni dodatak iste vrste čvora rezultira normalnim čvorom s mogućom lokalnom preinakom, umjesto sukoba stabla.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_update_add_as_modification)
#: src/settings/subversion_settings.ui:200
#, kde-format
msgid "Update modifies instead of creating conflicts"
msgstr "Ažuriranje mijenja umjesto stvaranja sukoba"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_update_make_parents)
#: src/settings/subversion_settings.ui:207
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>If set, create any non-existent parent directories "
"also by checking them out at depth=empty</p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>Ako je postavljeno, kreirajte sve nepostojeće nadređene direktorije također tako da ih provjerite na depth=empty</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_update_make_parents)
#: src/settings/subversion_settings.ui:210
#, kde-format
msgid "Update makes missing parents"
msgstr "Ažuriranje čini nestale roditelje"

